Subject: IR6 Mailbox Carrier Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

@ [fixture_plan] docs/fixtures/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Fixture_Plan.v1.sop
@ [mailbox_carrier_contract] docs/coordination/IR6_Rendezvous_And_Mailbox_Carrier_Projection_Contract.v1.sop
@ [activation_boundary] docs/implementation/IR6_Bounded_Coordination_Implementation_Activation_Boundary.v1.sop

& [ExpectedMailboxCarrierLedger: IR6CoordinationMailbox] is the expected mailbox carrier ledger
  + [mailbox_carrier_envelope_required] is true
  + [carrier_authority_status] is carrier_context_only
  + [mailbox_file_read_authorized] is false
  + [mailbox_file_write_authorized] is false
  + [read_cursor_persistence_authorized] is false
  + [required_field] is carrier_surface
  + [required_field] is mailbox_last_modified_ms
  + [required_field] is read_cursor_ms
  + [required_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_field] is required_route_set

& [ExpectedMailboxCarrierCaseSet: IR6CoordinationMailbox] is the per-fixture mailbox carrier ledger
  + [fixture_id] is release_notice_with_lineage
    + [expected_carrier_status] is rendezvous_projection_only
  + [fixture_id] is inbox_unread_notice_blocks_ready
    + [expected_freshness_state] is pending_review
    + [expected_ready_state] is blocked
  + [fixture_id] is read_cursor_stale_projection
    + [expected_freshness_state] is stale
    + [expected_read_cursor_authority] is false
  + [fixture_id] is mailbox_carrier_authority_refusal
    + [expected_carrier_authority_status] is carrier_context_only
    + [expected_status] is refused

  = must: preserve mailbox paths, timestamps, cursor ids, and message ids as carrier context only
  = must: fail future implementation that creates, reads, writes, or mutates platform mailbox files without explicit authorization
